  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "core-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 760,
      "page": "page-1",
      "text": "One record set, many presentations.\nGrid, board and timeline are the same rows under different view settings (F013). Brand hue and light/dark are live tweaks on every artboard."
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 760,
      "page": "page-2",
      "text": "Reporting reads across sources; it never copies them.\nEvery number traces to rows the viewer is allowed to see. AI proposals stop at a diff and change nothing until approved."
    },
    {
      "id": "ent-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 760,
      "page": "page-3",
      "text": "Enterprise surfaces.\nEntra sign-in sits beside password and SAML, never replacing them. Billing credit applies before any charge. Mobile is a submission and review surface, not a second product."
    },
    {
      "id": "system-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 760,
      "page": "page-4",
      "text": "Build order: tokens -> MUI theme -> components.\nTanStack Table supplies headless grid state and renders through themed MUI components; MUI X Charts and Date Pickers are MIT. No paid grid package and no second UI library."
    },
    {
      "id": "public-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 760,
      "page": "page-5",
      "text": "Unauthenticated surfaces.\nNo session, no account, no tenant discovery. A recipient sees only the fields shared with them; a published page renders as the publisher's permissions at request time and shows an error state, never stale data, if that access is lost."
    },
    {
      "id": "mod-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -150,
      "w": 760,
      "page": "page-6",
      "text": "Modules and administration.\nEach advanced module is entitled, permission-aware, audited and reversible. Dynamic View shows the rule the whole tier depends on: a recipient sees three fields of eighteen and one row of 1,284, and can never infer the shape of what is withheld."
    }
  ],
  "launch": {
    "view": "canvas",
    "page": "page-1"
  }
}